prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years for March to April and again for November to December. In 2026, the middle ran 9% of normal for February to March and 10% of normal for March to April. Every grid in Ford County had its driest year in 1956, at between 42% and 48% of normal.</p>"}
